<Layout title="About ClearCalc Tools" description="Learn why ClearCalc builds simple, transparent online calculators."><section class="legal"><span class="eyebrow">ABOUT US</span><h1>Numbers should feel simple.</h1><p>ClearCalc Tools is an independent library of free calculators designed to turn everyday questions into clear, useful estimates.</p><h2>Our approach</h2><p>We prioritize readable interfaces, transparent assumptions, mobile performance, and original explanatory content. Our calculators are informational and are reviewed as the site evolves.</p><h2>Editorial standards</h2><p>We explain what each tool does, avoid presenting estimates as professional advice, and correct errors when they are identified.</p></section></Layout>
